{"schema":"scion.state/2.0","id":"poem_09","num":"09","title":"YET, HEARD","tagline":"three calls before leaving","district":"The Shrouded Arcade","color":"#be5791","src_fps":12,"xsheet_fps":24,"frames":168,"seconds":14.0,"assets":{"cel":"assets/poem_09_cel.webp","rough":"assets/poem_09_rough.webp","masks":"assets/poem_09_masks.webp","atlas":{"cols":12,"rows":14,"cell":[384,216],"count":168},"rough_atlas":{"cols":12,"rows":14,"cell":[256,144],"count":168},"mask_atlas":{"cols":14,"rows":1,"cell":[256,144],"count":14},"video":"../video/poem_09/cartoon.mp4"},"cuts":[],"dramatic":{"two_seconds_before":"three calls before leaving. Before frame 1 we are already inside 'THE SHARED MOON': the city was moving before the camera arrived, so the opening beat is a stimulus already in progress, not a cold start.","causal_chain":["ANTICIPATION","ACTION_EXTREME","CONTACT_OVERSHOOT","SETTLE"],"beats":[{"id":"B01","role":"ANTICIPATION","heuristic":true,"f_in":0,"f_out":11,"dur_src":11,"dur_24":22,"energy":12.662,"camera_speed":0.022,"sign":"affect","sign_image":"Affection-image","verb":"the body/camera loads against the coming move \u2014 the figure against floor, street lamp, road","movement":"THE SHARED MOON","line":"Before I go, we look at the moon the way we used to see it. We talk for years, travel through time \u2014 we grow old together, I believe. Maybe we could have it all.","key_frame":10,"mask_key":12,"opens_on_cut":false},{"id":"B02","role":"ACTION_EXTREME","heuristic":true,"f_in":11,"f_out":58,"dur_src":47,"dur_24":94,"energy":15.331,"camera_speed":0.019,"sign":"action","sign_image":"Action-image (SAS)","verb":"the move reaches its extreme \u2014 the figure against floor, street, road","movement":"THE SHARED MOON","line":"Before I go, we look at the moon the way we used to see it. We talk for years, travel through time \u2014 we grow old together, I believe. Maybe we could have it all.","key_frame":49,"mask_key":48,"opens_on_cut":false},{"id":"B03","role":"CONTACT_OVERSHOOT","heuristic":true,"f_in":58,"f_out":112,"dur_src":54,"dur_24":108,"energy":7.375,"camera_speed":0.13,"sign":"reflection","sign_image":"Reflection-image (ASA)","verb":"the move lands and overshoots \u2014 floor against column, street lamp","movement":"HIS FOOTSTEPS, RETRACED","line":"Before I go, I call on my father \u2014 his calming demeanor summoned from the yonders. We walk for years, east toward the sunrises, retracing his footsteps \u2014 my tears falling in the wave shadows of the inner harbor.","key_frame":111,"mask_key":108,"opens_on_cut":false},{"id":"B04","role":"SETTLE","heuristic":true,"f_in":112,"f_out":168,"dur_src":56,"dur_24":112,"energy":9.596,"camera_speed":0.041,"sign":"time","sign_image":"Time-image","verb":"the world settles into the aftermath \u2014 building against window, sky","movement":"EAST, AT THE HARBOR","line":"We stroll, father and son, hearted and shaken. Someone borrowed, and someone blue \u2014 yet, broken. Yet, heard.","key_frame":117,"mask_key":120,"opens_on_cut":false}],"keys":[{"id":"K01","frame":10,"beat":"B01","role":"ANTICIPATION","silhouette_key":12},{"id":"K02","frame":49,"beat":"B02","role":"ACTION_EXTREME","silhouette_key":48},{"id":"K03","frame":111,"beat":"B03","role":"CONTACT_OVERSHOOT","silhouette_key":108},{"id":"K04","frame":117,"beat":"B04","role":"SETTLE","silhouette_key":120}],"flip_test":{"mean_key_change":0.491,"reads":true,"note":"keys must differ enough to tell the story with no in-betweens"},"staging_topologies":[{"frame":0,"horizon":0.446,"figure_scale":0.176,"negative_space":0.824,"silhouette_contrast":0.119,"occluder_P0":0.0,"selected":true},{"frame":96,"horizon":0.145,"figure_scale":0.007,"negative_space":0.993,"silhouette_contrast":0.034,"occluder_P0":0.203},{"frame":84,"horizon":0.118,"figure_scale":0.008,"negative_space":0.992,"silhouette_contrast":0.031,"occluder_P0":0.205}]},"multiplane":{"z":{"P0":0.2,"P1":0.5,"P2":1.0,"P3":1.2,"P4":2.5,"P5":6.0,"P6":null},"roles":{"P0":"Lens mask / extreme for